{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788378924604357001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"geode-joking-cockatiel","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":6,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"a2ea157165555236049addb91c1e0d2060d7f67862419224136de16a6e8d29e0","event_uuid":"9252ddcf-0ad9-44c7-8655-3ffbfabed723","position":{"commit_sha":"3d3f71efaf121b6041c424ae04b6520f913108d3","position":"1788375027121878666-9252ddcf-0ad9-44c7-8655-3ffbfabed723"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c4ff2846c358332c969d0087d628e618f47adb12063b604e7c31404fe35fb331","event_uuid":"603b1bfb-bdc8-43d9-9853-b59a7a455737","position":{"commit_sha":"18c83969103b6097631a1e2cf21a0d92ec4dd829","position":"1788375088188859144-603b1bfb-bdc8-43d9-9853-b59a7a455737"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"1802c9ff3cacbca8e45c2f491701f01e001966b152acdc85c03aae709fc0b453","event_uuid":"360768ec-0dc6-4884-9298-d8ef061f626c","position":{"commit_sha":"8854fd55c12b5f500ce5d503623329691f9b914c","position":"1788375230066706562-360768ec-0dc6-4884-9298-d8ef061f626c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"de341789cf56544b24839ce3a04d918055a5c501099c8063ed0d194a833502c5","event_uuid":"fa9f6e81-0a65-44dc-b282-710355ebad05","position":{"commit_sha":"ff92ea4fa8f60c4ed2781af452f9099e570712c1","position":"1788375841848980925-fa9f6e81-0a65-44dc-b282-710355ebad05"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c090711123a997b3795d088b6995cb29c624ab60b79acf863ea975e84a9fe9dd","event_uuid":"f4d7b251-7f94-473d-adfb-cee391b85f1e","position":{"commit_sha":"1df72fa87289cbc1d49d1a5b4572a577b734f301","position":"1788375888496212795-f4d7b251-7f94-473d-adfb-cee391b85f1e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"3c40e7dd89e889346b6385bcab3516a98c43a1d84adbd7023712e1ffe4f7e5a8","event_uuid":"39f2a185-5efe-48b2-b0ad-2f850735aa60","position":{"commit_sha":"537f99deef1ed67b06ff2c21643f0956ef77262d","position":"1788376362608438024-39f2a185-5efe-48b2-b0ad-2f850735aa60"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788375027121878666,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[],"description":"# S2 — Cap Docker overlay2 and BuildKit cache with per-generator alarms\n\n## Why\nDocker overlay/image layers and BuildKit cache were major root-volume consumers in the incident. Existing prune logic is reactive and can run without recovering enough space; it does not impose a hard per-generator ceiling.\n\n## What\nConfigure Docker/BuildKit-supported GC ceilings for Docker image/overlay2 accumulation and BuildKit build cache. Use supported Docker/BuildKit APIs/config (`buildkitd.toml` `gc`, `maxUsedSpace`, `minFreeSpace`, `reservedSpace`, or equivalent `docker builder prune --keep-storage` policy), never direct deletion under `/var/lib/docker`. Add separate observability metrics and CloudWatch alarms for Docker overlay/image and BuildKit cache saturation.\n\n## Scope\nIn scope: host Docker/BuildKit config, autodeploy prune integration, observability metrics, Terraform alarms, runbook updates, and tests. Out of scope: review scratch volume, journald, `/var/tmp`, and writable-container-layer reaping.\n\n## Grounding\n- Root alarm text names Docker image/build-cache storage: `infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf:207-215`.\n- Existing reactive prune behavior: `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:132-140`, `:367-384`, `:410-445`.\n- Docker overlay2 docs describe image/container layers under `/var/lib/docker/overlay2` and warn not to manipulate `/var/lib/docker` directly; BuildKit docs define GC cap knobs.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Docker/BuildKit configuration imposes explicit upper bounds for build cache and Docker layer/image accumulation.\n- [ ] Existing safe prune behavior is preserved or simplified without deleting tagged rollback images.\n- [ ] Observability publishes separate Docker overlay/image and BuildKit cache usage/cap metrics.\n- [ ] Terraform declares dedicated CloudWatch alarms for Docker overlay/image and BuildKit cache saturation, wired to SNS.\n- [ ] Runbook explains diagnosis/remediation for each Docker generator and forbids direct `/var/lib/docker` deletion.\n- [ ] Targeted tests cover config generation, observability parsing, alarm actions, and rollback-image safety.\n- [ ] Portability criterion: solution uses Docker/BuildKit host config and local script tests; no CI-provider-specific trigger is required.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","reason":"Make Docker prune/build-cache behavior cap-aware while preserving rollback image safety."},{"path":"infra/scripts/compose-up.sh","reason":"Install or refresh Docker/BuildKit daemon configuration if needed."},{"path":"infra/scripts/observability.sh","reason":"Publish Docker overlay/image and BuildKit cache usage/cap metrics."},{"path":"infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf","reason":"Add Docker overlay/image and BuildKit cache CloudWatch alarms."},{"path":"infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","reason":"Document Docker cap alarms and safe remediation."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_autodeploy_prune.py","reason":"Cover Docker prune command construction and rollback-image invariants."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_disk_pressure.py","reason":"Cover pressure reclaim integration."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_observability_disk_pressure.py","reason":"Cover Docker/BuildKit metric emission."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py","reason":"Assert new alarm action wiring."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","6202-e1c7-c57f-4897"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6202-e1c7-c57f-4897","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["infra","gerrit","disk-ceiling","docker"],"ticket_id":"9183-aaae-667d-45e6","ticket_type":"story","title":"S2 — Cap Docker overlay2 and BuildKit cache with per-generator alarms","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_autodeploy_prune.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_disk_pressure.py tests/scripts/test_observability_disk_pressure.py tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py","dd_id":"AC3","dd_text":"Docker/BuildKit cap metrics and alarms are covered."},{"command":"terraform -chdir=infra/terraform validate","dd_id":"AC4","dd_text":"Terraform syntax remains valid."}]},"source_event_uuids":["9252ddcf-0ad9-44c7-8655-3ffbfabed723","603b1bfb-bdc8-43d9-9853-b59a7a455737","360768ec-0dc6-4884-9298-d8ef061f626c","fa9f6e81-0a65-44dc-b282-710355ebad05","f4d7b251-7f94-473d-adfb-cee391b85f1e","39f2a185-5efe-48b2-b0ad-2f850735aa60"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788378924604357001,"uuid":"9aa32486-11b0-4568-b201-f7cd27a05a4a"}